			"notes": "## Contents Added  \nLiquid Media  \nLiquid Soul  \nCircle Amplifier  \nDisplay Source support for Akashic Bookshelf, Slate, Impetus  \nMany spell patterns about Create, but their introduction haven't been finished, will be included in next version  \n  \n## 新内容  \n液态媒质  \n液态灵魂  \n法术环增幅器  \n显示连接器对阿卡夏书架，石板，促动石的显示支持  \n一些关于机械动力的法术图案，但他们的介绍还没做好，将会在下个版本完善  \n  \nThis is just a test version, it is common to have bugs.  \n这是一个测试的版本，非常不完善，肯定很多bug"
